## 📅 Packaging & Publishing | 打包上传 PyPI | PyPI公開

### 1. Build Package

```bash
python setup.py sdist build
```

Or:

```bash
python3 setup.py sdist bdist_wheel
```

### 2. Install Required Tools

```bash
pip install --upgrade setuptools wheel twine
```

### 3. Upload to PyPI

```bash
twine upload dist/*
```

### 4. Test Installation

```bash
pip install your-package-name
```

